  "the acceptance profile is one fixed local shape scaled by a single per-prompt level; a prompt whose profile has a different SHAPE is not represented.",
  "acceptance is drawn independently per position within a round, which rung 0 already showed the board rejects as a complete model.",
  "no stop token is simulated inside the window, so `stoppedEarly` is always false and every short round is a real reject."
